# Keep the build context small and never let a secret or a build artifact into the image.
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/node_modules
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
tests
storage
*.md
**/*.user
**/TestResults
# The feed's token as Render hands it over: a secret file in the context root (the build mounts it, never copies it).
nuget
